# The fork child's orphaned cell: no thread of the child holds the cell
# a parent thread was discovering into (the forking-thread residue is in
# the axiom's doc).
axiom_cell_orphaned	platform/kernel fact	none (assumption)
# Runs until the reader reports the end or an error.
scan_lines	termination	none (assumption)
# The discovery scratch is the claim winner's alone: the record's PENDING->RUNNING
# exchange lets one thread through (the fork-child residue aside).
discovery_scratch	allocator invariant	none (assumption)
# A raw in-place write, like `Arena::put_stats`: zero bytes are a valid
# `Cgroup`, then the state and the UNLIMITED stores (the test
# `untracked_in_place_is_untracked` compares the fields); nothing here is
# an atomics protocol for loom to check.
untracked_in_place	raw pointer (internal)	RefinedRust
